   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Machine Learning Model Training Workflow\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates a complete ML workflow for geospatial prediction:\n",\n",
    "1. **Data Ingestion**: Load training data\n",\n",
    "2. **Feature Engineering**: Create spatial and temporal features\n",\n",
    "3. **Model Training**: Train multiple algorithms and compare\n",\n",
    "4. **Model Validation**: Cross-validation and performance metrics\n",\n",
    "5. **Prediction**: Apply model to new data\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "## Use Case\n",\n",
    "Predict property values based on geospatial characteristics"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup and Data Loading"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import requests\n",
    "import json\n",\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "# API Configuration\n",\n",
    "API_BASE = 'http://localhost:8080'\n",\n",
    "headers = {'Content-Type': 'application/json'}\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "# Authenticate\n",\n",
    "auth = requests.post(\n",\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/auth/login',\n",\n",\n",
    "    json={'username': 'admin', 'password': 'changeme'}\n",\n",
    ")\n",\n",
    "token = auth.json()['data']['token']\n",\n",
    "headers['Authorization'] = f'Bearer {token}'\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "print('✓ Setup complete')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Training Data Ingestion"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Real estate data with geospatial information\n",\n",
    "training_data = {\n",\n",
